  "status_note": "Edition CONFIRMED (bir.md s1). Bindings CONFIRMED for the pin. Payroll rules are design targets for P6; MVP does not fill 1601-C. Rule set r2 is a thin mapping: accounting measure to crosswalk input key (fill_class input) with lineage. Books holds no rate, election, threshold, applicability test, ATC choice, due date or penalty (ADR-0007).",
